Project:  axi_obi, the AXI4 to OBI protocol converters of the PULP Platform
URL:      https://github.com/pulp-platform/axi_obi
Commit:   205c9bb338df6955a0c4a300c5140d9ce413ec56 (the version the port was written against;
          no file here is a verbatim copy, so the commit cannot be confirmed by comparison)
Licence:  upstream is Solderpad Hardware License 0.51, text in LICENSE.axi_obi
Local:    mosaic_axi_to_obi.sv, mosaic_axi_burst_to_obi.sv and mosaic_obi_to_axi.sv are
          MOSAIC rewrites of the upstream axi_to_obi and obi_to_axi converters. They are
          specialised to 32-bit address and data and take the X-HEEP OBI structs as type
          parameters instead of the PULP obi_pkg configuration. mosaic_axi_to_obi.sv
          and mosaic_obi_to_axi.sv keep the upstream copyright line and SHL-0.51;
          mosaic_axi_burst_to_obi.sv is new and declares "Apache-2.0 WITH SHL-2.1".
